{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-27T20:22:56.908Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented \"Sidecars at archive\" for change 105:\n\n**`src/watcher/archive-sidecars.ts`** (new) — `applyArchiveSidecars`:\n- Reads `creates` via `readCreates`, and for each entry with a group whose capability now has a living spec and no sidecar, writes `formatSidecar({ group })`.\n- Copies each replacement `specs/<capability>/osq.yml` the change carries byte-for-byte over the living sidecar (applied last, so it wins).\n\n**`src/watcher/archiver.ts`** — calls `applyArchiveSidecars` right after `applyOpenSpecDeltas`.\n\n**`src/core/run/manifest.ts`** — `buildManifest` records `hashes[\"<capability>/osq.yml\"]` via `hashFileContent` for every capability it already hashes (null when absent).\n\n**`tests/archive-sidecars.test.ts`** (new) — covers all four requirement scenarios through `archiveSpecFolder` on temp projects plus `buildManifest`.\n\nVerification: task `verify` 5/5 passes; existing archiver/manifest/budget tests pass; proposal's `pnpm verify` exits 0. Result written to `openspec/changes/105-capability-sidecar/.run/results/3.md`."}}
